      "updated": 1788232574677,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "langchain is an open source framework for developing applications powered by LLM.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "langchain is an open source framework for developing applications powered by LLM.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "xUeaCK9XM9HQi0UNXPhti",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 779.1494465977696,
      "y": 5864.665984024047,
      "width": 363,
      "height": 175,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2c",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1880234642,
      "version": 120,
      "versionNonce": 1939093241,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788232574677,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In Langchain we have 6 components\n1 Models\n2 Prompts\n3 Chains\n4 Memory\n5 Indexes\n6 Agents",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In Langchain we have 6 components\n1 Models\n2 Prompts\n3 Chains\n4 Memory\n5 Indexes\n6 Agents",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Q1uKvC4wC52Hyo35muPqq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 777.0283528477696,
      "y": 6127.665984024047,
      "width": 99,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2d",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1782446222,
      "version": 12,
      "versionNonce": 1747554583,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788232574677,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Models ->",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Models ->",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "Pr_BSbi-JAPLrg8zvyNd7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 823.8877278477696,
      "y": 6157.611296524047,
      "width": 1177,
      "height": 525,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2h",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1205129550,
      "version": 1459,
      "versionNonce": 902098905,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788232574677,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "In langchain models are the core interfaces through which we interact with AI models.\n\nIn NLP people want to make Chatbot, IN the world of NLP everyone want to create their own\nchatbot. but there were 2 majore issues, like \n1 user query how our chatbot will understand\n2 Even if chatbot is getting query, then it should give correct response, this is also a big\nchallenge\n\nTo solve these 2 , lot of work was done, eventually LLM comes, and LLM solved both of these together.\nTo train LLM we have used whole internet data, due to that it has Natural Language understading, also\nit has context aware text generation capability.\n\nthese two problems are solved but one new problem into the picture, due to LLM are trained on internet\ndata, it has billions of parameters, due to that size of LLM is very huze like greater than 100 GB.\ndue to that small companies can't run this by putting it in their machines. itna jada cloud ka bill aega\nki we will not pay.\n\nThis challenge was solved by APIs, Google, OpenAI have prepared APIs, we just need to call API and api will\ngive response, howmuch we will use api, we will pay accordingly.\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "In langchain models are the core interfaces through which we interact with AI models.\n\nIn NLP people want to make Chatbot, IN the world of NLP everyone want to create their own\nchatbot. but there were 2 majore issues, like \n1 user query how our chatbot will understand\n2 Even if chatbot is getting query, then it should give correct response, this is also a big\nchallenge\n\nTo solve these 2 , lot of work was done, eventually LLM comes, and LLM solved both of these together.\nTo train LLM we have used whole internet data, due to that it has Natural Language understading, also\nit has context aware text generation capability.\n\nthese two problems are solved but one new problem into the picture, due to LLM are trained on internet\ndata, it has billions of parameters, due to that size of LLM is very huze like greater than 100 GB.\ndue to that small companies can't run this by putting it in their machines. itna jada cloud ka bill aega\nki we will not pay.\n\nThis challenge was solved by APIs, Google, OpenAI have prepared APIs, we just need to call API and api will\ngive response, howmuch we will use api, we will pay accordingly.\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
