      "updated": 1788232574677,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "input of LLM is prompt\nprompts are very important for LLM, output of LLM is much more dependent on LLM. these are very \nsensitive towards prompt, if we will change little in prompt,response will change much more.\nthere is field of study around Prompt, around this we will see multiple job opportunities as \nwell, the name of this field is prompt engineering. job profile is prompt engineers.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "input of LLM is prompt\nprompts are very important for LLM, output of LLM is much more dependent on LLM. these are very \nsensitive towards prompt, if we will change little in prompt,response will change much more.\nthere is field of study around Prompt, around this we will see multiple job opportunities as \nwell, the name of this field is prompt engineering. job profile is prompt engineers.",
