      "originalText": "Chains -> ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
    {
      "id": "jtRYnjU7AQVXWsNQqObw7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 721.3877278477696,
      "y": 11432.705046524046,
      "width": 1100,
      "height": 500,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffc9c9",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2w",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1995360943,
      "version": 1043,
      "versionNonce": 1849884919,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1788232574677,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Important componet, on top of this its name is langchain\nwith the help of chains we can create pipeline, any application we can break into pipeline and this\npipeline we can create using chains.\n\nExample -> we need to create LLM application where user will give english text around 1000 word and \n    we need to give 100 word summary\n\n\n\ninput -> LLM -> transated text by LLM -> LLM -> this will generate summary \n\nif we dont have chains, we need to do it manually. here in this we need to take output from one step\nand we will send it to next step\n\nbut chains will automatically send output of one as input of next, so we no need to send input \nmanually.\n\nprevious stage output will automatically become input for next stage. \n\nWith the help of chains we can create complex pipelines.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Important componet, on top of this its name is langchain\nwith the help of chains we can create pipeline, any application we can break into pipeline and this\npipeline we can create using chains.\n\nExample -> we need to create LLM application where user will give english text around 1000 word and \n    we need to give 100 word summary\n\n\n\ninput -> LLM -> transated text by LLM -> LLM -> this will generate summary \n\nif we dont have chains, we need to do it manually. here in this we need to take output from one step\nand we will send it to next step\n\nbut chains will automatically send output of one as input of next, so we no need to send input \nmanually.\n\nprevious stage output will automatically become input for next stage. \n\nWith the help of chains we can create complex pipelines.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "labelPosition": null
    },
